flowchart TB
    Owner["Workspace Owner/Admin\n(sets up & manages workspace)"]
    Member["Member\n(team user)"]
    Guest["Guest\n(no account, joins via link)"]

    WiChat(["WiChat\nSelf-hosted, plugin-based\nteam communication platform"])

    Google["Google OAuth\n(external identity provider)"]
    LiveKitExt["LiveKit\n(self-hosted voice/video SFU,\nrun alongside WiChat)"]
    SMTP["SMTP Server\n(email for password reset)"]
    Plugins["Installed Plugins\n(Task Board, Whiteboard,\nVirtual Office, etc.)"]

    Owner -->|manages workspace,\ninstalls plugins| WiChat
    Member -->|chats, calls, collaborates| WiChat
    Guest -->|joins a channel via link| WiChat

    WiChat -->|authenticates via| Google
    WiChat -->|delegates voice/video to| LiveKitExt
    WiChat -->|sends password-reset email via| SMTP
    WiChat -->|loads UI & delegates features to| Plugins
